PROPRIETARY — NOT OPEN SOURCE (provisional)

This repository contains research software developed for the FACE
trans-diagnostic phenotyping project (Bipolar / Schizophrenia / Depression).
It is made available for internal scientific collaboration and editorial peer
review only.

Until the FACE consortium adopts a definitive distribution license, the
following terms apply:

1. No license, express or implied, is granted to copy, modify, distribute,
   sublicense, or use this software outside the FACE consortium and its
   designated collaborators, except as strictly required for editorial peer
